OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786726080
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to motorcyclist
OL,4,Cwith 'heart of gold' following tunnel
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe family of a man who died in a
OL,8,Fcollision inside of a tunnel have paid
OL,9,Ftribute to a "son, brother, and
OL,10,Ffriend" with a "heart of gold".
OL,12,FKorben Bell, from Cheshire, died in
OL,13,Fhospital on Wednesday 12 August 2026
OL,14,Fafter his Sur-ron bike crashed inside
OL,15,Fof the Queensway Tunnel between
OL,16,FBirkenhead and Liverpool the day
OL,17,Fbefore.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786726080
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to motorcyclist
OL,4,Cwith 'heart of gold' following tunnel
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FIn a statement, his family described
OL,8,Fthe 24-year-old as "a boy with a heart
OL,9,Fof gold and a smile that could light
OL,10,Fup any room."
OL,12,FThey went on to say: "Korben was the
OL,13,Fbest son, brother, uncle, partner and
OL,14,Ffriend and loved by everyone who had
OL,15,Fthe privilege of knowing him.
OL,17,F"He had a way of making everyone
OL,18,Flaugh, wherever he went and brought so
OL,19,Fmuch happiness and positivity to the
OL,20,Fpeople around him no matter what.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786726080
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to motorcyclist
OL,4,Cwith 'heart of gold' following tunnel
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"From our beautiful blue-eyed, blond-
OL,8,Fhaired boy, to the gorgeous man he
OL,9,Fgrew into, we will forever be so proud
OL,10,Fto call you ours.
OL,12,F"Our hearts are completely broken.
OL,13,FThere are no words to describe the
OL,14,Fpain of losing you.
OL,16,F"This isn't goodbye, our boy. It's
OL,17,Fsimply until we see you again.
OL,19,F"Loved by us all, always."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786726080
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to motorcyclist
OL,4,Cwith 'heart of gold' following tunnel
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe collision occurred approximately
OL,8,Ftwo thirds of the way through the
OL,9,Ftunnel towards Liverpool, and only
OL,10,Finvolved his bike.
OL,12,FDetective Sergeant Kurt Timpson, the
OL,13,FLead Investigating Officer from the
OL,14,FMerseyside Police Serious Collision
OL,15,FInvestigation Unit, said: "My thoughts
OL,16,Fremain with Korben's family at this
OL,17,Fdesperately sad time, they are being
OL,18,Fsupported by specially trained family
OL,19,Fliaison officers.
OL,26,@wD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
