CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1786726080
OL,3,CFamily pay tribute to motorcyclist
OL,4,Cwith 'heart of gold' following tunnel
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"I am particularly interested in
OL,8,Fanyone who saw the bike approaching/
OL,9,Fentering the tunnel booths at
OL,10,FBirkenhead or the drivers of the
OL,11,Fvehicles travelling westbound towards
OL,12,FBirkenhead who may had witnessed the
OL,13,Fcollision. In addition if anyone has
OL,14,Fdash cameras fitted to their vehicle,
OL,15,Fplease check if the incident has been
OL,16,Fcaptured."
OL,26,@xD@JO]
